---
/* L13 - temperature: the top probability falls, the label does not move. */
---

<figure class="fig">
  <div class="fig__frame">
    <img
      class="fig__picture"
      src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}illustrations/L13.jpg`}
      alt="A line drawing of three judges seated behind a long desk holding score cards, with one judge's hand turning a large dial and three columns of stacked coins beside the desk changing height."
    />
    <svg
      class="fig__svg"
      viewBox="0 0 640 340"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="L13-fig-title L13-fig-desc"
    >
      <title id="L13-fig-title">The top probability falls past the threshold, the label does not</title>
      <desc id="L13-fig-desc">
        A horizontal probability axis carries three dots: 0.41 for T = 4.0,
        0.63 for T = 1.0 and 0.98 for T = 0.25, each labelled underneath. A
        dashed vertical line marks the threshold 0.6. A prussian ring travels
        from 0.98 down to 0.41 along the axis, crossing the threshold on the
        way, while the note says that billing is top at every temperature.
      </desc>

      <text x="80" y="60" class="fig-text fig-text--ink">probability of the top option</text>
      <text x="440" y="62" class="fig-text fig-text--ink">the ranking never changes</text>
      <text x="440" y="80" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">billing is top at every T</text>

      <!-- the axis -->
      <line x1="80" y1="250" x2="560" y2="250" class="fig-axis-line" />
      <g class="fig-tick">
        <line x1="80" y1="250" x2="80" y2="257" />
        <line x1="176" y1="250" x2="176" y2="257" />
        <line x1="272" y1="250" x2="272" y2="257" />
        <line x1="368" y1="250" x2="368" y2="257" />
        <line x1="464" y1="250" x2="464" y2="257" />
        <line x1="560" y1="250" x2="560" y2="257" />
      </g>

      <!-- the threshold -->
      <line x1="368" y1="250" x2="368" y2="70" stroke="var(--color-prussian)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
      <text x="368" y="62" class="fig-text" fill="var(--color-prussian)" text-anchor="middle">threshold 0.6</text>

      <!-- the three probabilities -->
      <circle cx="277" cy="250" r="4.5" fill="var(--color-ink)" />
      <circle cx="382" cy="250" r="4.5" fill="var(--color-ink)" />
      <circle cx="550" cy="250" r="4.5" fill="var(--color-ink)" />

      <text x="277" y="270" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--ink" text-anchor="middle">0.41</text>
      <text x="382" y="270" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--ink" text-anchor="middle">0.63</text>
      <text x="550" y="270" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--ink" text-anchor="middle">0.98</text>

      <text x="277" y="288" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--dim" text-anchor="middle">T = 4.0</text>
      <text x="382" y="288" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--dim" text-anchor="middle">T = 1.0</text>
      <text x="550" y="288" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--dim" text-anchor="middle">T = 0.25</text>

      <!-- the travelling marker: the one idea of motion -->
      <g class="L13-travel">
        <circle cx="550" cy="250" r="7" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-prussian)" stroke-width="2" />
        <text x="550" y="230" class="fig-text" fill="var(--color-prussian)" text-anchor="middle">p_top</text>
      </g>

      <text x="80" y="312" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">entropy: 0 when one-hot, log(3) is about 1.0986 when uniform</text>
      <text x="460" y="312" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">T = 0 is forbidden</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="fig__caption">
    <span class="edge-code">figure L13</span>
    <span class="fig__caption-text">As the temperature rises the top option's probability falls from 0.98 to 0.41 and crosses the 0.6 threshold, so the action changes while the top label does not.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--color-ink-70);
  }

  .fig-text--ink {
    fill: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .fig-text--dim {
    fill: var(--color-ink-45);
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .fig-text--num {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .fig-axis-line {
    stroke: var(--color-rule);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .fig-tick line {
    stroke: var(--color-rule);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  /* the one idea of motion: the top probability travelling down the axis */
  @keyframes L13-travel {
    from {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
    to {
      transform: translateX(-273px);
    }
  }

  .L13-travel {
    animation: L13-travel 2.4s ease-in-out both;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .L13-travel {
      animation: none !important;
      transform: translateX(-273px);
    }
  }
</style>
